+## Deepin
+
+A source-backed port of the Deepin Desktop Environment (DDE 25): DTK light and dark palettes, a full-width translucent dock (the shared taskbar, on any
+edge) with a centred launcher, tasks, tray and clock, 50 px Chameleon-sized window titles. Unaffiliated with Deepin / UnionTech. The matching Bloom icons and
+cursors are separate packs pinned in `assets/desktop-ports/deepin/asset-packs.toml` and installed with `decthemectl assets install deepin-bloom`; the theme
+never selects them. Measurements, gaps and evidence: [desktop-ports/deepin](desktop-ports/deepin/README.md).
+
+Tags: deepin, dde, dtk, light, dark, translucent, dock. Apply: `decthemectl theme apply deepin`
+
